        <mxCell id="w3gIskLWpIx1pYHVEfpo-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div class=&quot;RLrADb&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; align-items: flex-start; display: flex; flex-direction: column; color: rgb(227, 227, 227); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(30, 31, 32);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;jO4O1&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; border-radius: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1.25rem 0.25rem; background-color: rgb(48, 48, 48); display: flex; gap: 0.625rem; justify-content: flex-end; max-width: 13.75rem; padding: 0.75rem; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ptNLrf&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; padding: 0px; position: relative; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: 0px; word-break: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Setup: We wish to build an app where users can subscribe to stock, crypto and other assets and are notified when price changes by a given amount.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;- Users have a list of stock subscriptions. These include the crypto asset symbol (e.g. BTC), as well as a rule for when they want to be notified (e.g. price goes up by 5% since start of day, or price dropped by more than $50).&lt;br/&gt;- When a rule is triggered, the user is notified by either SMS or email.&lt;br/&gt;- Imagine that we have data feeds set up for asset prices on some sort of queueing system (e.g. Kafka). Each asset ticks once per second.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;RLrADb&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; align-items: flex-start; display: flex; flex-direction: column; color: rgb(227, 227, 227); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;; text-align: left; background-color: rgb(30, 31, 32);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;jO4O1&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; border-radius: 0.25rem 1.25rem 1.25rem; background-color: rgb(48, 48, 48); display: flex; gap: 0.625rem; justify-content: flex-end; max-width: 13.75rem; padding: 0.75rem; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ptNLrf&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; padding: 0px; position: relative; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; letter-spacing: 0px; word-break: break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
