        <mxCell id="w3gIskLWpIx1pYHVEfpo-7" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;roundedPerimeter=1;" value="FR&lt;br&gt;1.User can able to subscribe to stock by amount or percentage, tyepically it can be increase or decrease or any percentage, by any type of notifcation&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. User should receiev the notification based on the stock price update&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
